<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for registering for the Scholar Overnight Experience at the West campus. Please keep this for your records.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Overnight Event Arrival information</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Date:</b> Wednesday, November 11 – Thursday, November 12, 2015</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Check-in:</b> 5:30 - 6 p.m.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Program:</b> 5:30 p.m. – 8 a.m.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Location:</b> Check in at the Casa De Oro Residence Hall</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>4811 W Verde Mall</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>Glendale, AZ 85306</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Overnight parking</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Parking requires a reservation. Make your reservation by contacting <a href="mailto:Angela.Huizar@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">Angela.Huizar@asu.edu</font></a>. &nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Please Note: Students will not be permitted to leave campus once checked-in to the program.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>What to bring</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Bring a change of clothing, sleeping bag, pillow, towel and any personal items (medication, soap, etc.). Luggage storage is available at 7:30 a.m. on Nov.12 during check-in for the Scholar Day event, please bring your luggage to the Barrett Honors Suite, UCB 201.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Meals</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">We will provide dinner and breakfast in our Verde Dining Pavilion for each overnight participant.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>What to send ahead of time</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">All students must complete student waivers in order to stay overnight in the residence hall. If under the age of 18 must have their parent/guardian complete the forms. Email the completed form to <a href="mailto:Angela.Huizar@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">Angela.Huizar@asu.edu</font></a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Scholar Day</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Your guests may participate in Day 2 of the event on Thursday, Nov. 12. We will send you a personalized agenda in a confirmation email so you can coordinate your parent or guardian’s arrival time and meeting location.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Parking</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Overnight parking in is available in Lot 19 (reservation required). For the next day’s event, please park in visitor Lot 12, your parking will be validated at the conclusion of the event.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Scholar Day Check-in</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Check-in for Monday’s Scholar Day Event begins at 8:30 a.m. in the Barrett Suite in University Center Building 205 (UCB201).</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">If you have questions regarding this event, please contact Sasha Billbe at <a href="mailto:Sasha.Billbe@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">Sasha.Billbe@asu.edu</font></a>.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Angela Huizer</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Program Coordinator</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">visit.asu.edu</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#c0c0c0" size="2">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#c0c0c0" size="2"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#c0c0c0" size="2">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>